{"pin":"AB00006","subcodes":[{"code":"AB00006","anchor":"","title":"Tafsir-i-Kuntu Kanzan Makhfiyyan (Commentary on the Hadith of the Hidden Treasure)","first_line":"Praise be to God Who hath stirred up the celestial spheres of being through the movement of divine attraction, and hath caused the oceans of existence to surge [3.5s]... ...And to continue: To him who looks at these lines and understands these indications, it is well known with respect to the request of that traveller… O Lord so rich in bounty, so replete with grace","first_line_orig":"الحمد لله الذی قد حرک افلاک الذوات بحرکه جذب صمدانیه و قد موج ابحر الکینونات  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"8270","full_text_parts":["O Lord so rich in bounty, so replete with grace,\n\nWhose knowledge doth mine inmost heart and soul embrace!\n\nAt morn, the solace of my soul is none but Thee; \n\nThe knower of my loss and woe is none but Thee.\n\nThe heart that for a moment hath Thy mention known \n\nWill seek no friend save longing pain for Thee alone.\n\nWithered be the heart that sigheth not for Thee, \n\nAnd better blind the eye that crieth not for Thee!\n\nIn all mine hours of deepest gloom, O Lord of might, \n\nMy heart hath Thy remembrance for a shining light.\n\nDo, through Thy favour, breathe Thy spirit into me, \n\nThat what hath never been may thus forever be.\n\nConsider not our merit and our worth,\n\nO Lord of bounty, but the grace Thou pourest forth.\n\nUpon these broken-winged birds whose flight is slow \n\nOut of Thy tender mercy newfound wings bestow."],"translations":[],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA13:411x","source":"INBA13","locator":"411x","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v013/?page=206"},{"kind":"music","code":"Ahdieh","source":"Ahdieh","url":"https://ahdieh.bandcamp.com/track/--12"},{"kind":"music","code":"L. Slott","source":"L","locator":"Slott","url":"https://youtu.be/OQIFMHgy9is"},{"kind":"music","code":"S. Rezaei and M. Vahman","source":"S","locator":"Rezaei and M. Vahman","url":"https://youtu.be/rrXXnCo47YQ"},{"kind":"music","code":"S. Taefi [track 13]","source":"S","locator":"Taefi [track 13]","url":"https://9starmedia.com/sonbol-taefi-along-the-tigris"},{"kind":"music","code":"S. Tirandaz","source":"S","locator":"Tirandaz","url":"https://tirandaz.bandcamp.com/track/praise-and-gratitude-5"},{"kind":"music","code":"unknown","source":"unknown","url":"https://youtu.be/IUEFUkWX7nk"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ADH2.070x","source":"ADH2","locator":"070x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/pdf/i/ishraq-khavari_adhkar_muqarrabin_2.pdf"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ADH2_2#09 p.101x","source":"ADH2_2#09 p.101x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/pdf/i/ishraq-khavari_adhkar_muqarrabin_2.pdf"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BMT.174","source":"BMT","locator":"174","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/258.pdf#page=177"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BRL_MON#26x","source":"BRL_MON","locator":"26x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/640088455"},{"kind":"publication","code":"HUV1.004x","source":"HUV1","locator":"004x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/621.pdf#page=4"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MJH.051x","source":"MJH","locator":"051x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MMAI/mmai-52.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MKT2.002","source":"MKT2","locator":"002","url":"https://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MA2/ma2-2.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMG2#120 p.135x","source":"MMG2","locator":"120 p.135x","url":"https://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MMA/mma-138.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"OOL.C028","source":"OOL","locator":"C028","url":"https://oceanoflights.org/abdul-baha-bkw28-fa"},{"kind":"publication","code":"VUJUD.139.18x","source":"VUJUD","locator":"139.18x","url":"http://bluefin.live/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Malakut-i-Vujud.pdf"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BLO_PT#024","source":"BLO_PT","locator":"024","url":"https://bahai-library.com/abdulbaha_kuntu_kanzan_makhfiyyan"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BRL_Aqdas.n023x","source":"BRL_Aqdas","locator":"n023x","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/561689094"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BRL_POAB#26x","source":"BRL_POAB","locator":"26x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/874596075"},{"kind":"translation","code":"JHT_A#005x","source":"JHT_A","locator":"005x"},{"kind":"translation","code":"SW_v08#06 p.062-063x","source":"SW_v08","locator":"06 p.062-063x","url":"https://bahai.works/Star_of_the_West/Volume_8/Issue_6"},{"kind":"translation","code":"VUJUDE.146x","source":"VUJUDE","locator":"146x","url":"http://bluefin.live/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/the_kingdom_of_existence.pdf"}]},{"code":"AB00006RIC","anchor":"ric","translations":[{"language":"pl","lang_name":"Polish"},{"language":"en","lang_name":"English"},{"language":"de","lang_name":"German"},{"language":"nl","lang_name":"Dutch"}]}]}
